i.github.com/users/khiav223577","html_url":"https://github.com/khiav223577","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khiav223577/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khiav223577/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khiav223577/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khiav223577/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khiav223577/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khiav223577/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khiav223577/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khiav223577/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khiav223577/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2018-12-21T07:15:09Z","updated_at":"2018-12-21T07:15:09Z","body":"I also have similar issues.\r\n\r\n### joins\r\n```rb\r\nUser.joins(:user_missions, 'AND user_missions.mission_id = 1').count\r\n```\r\nIt will generate this:\r\n```sql\r\nSELECT COUNT(*) FROM \"users\" \r\nINNER JOIN \"user_missions\" ON \"user_missions\".\"user_id\" = \"users\".\"id\" AND user_missions.mission_id = 1\r\n```\r\n\r\n### left_joins\r\n```rb\r\nUser.left_joins(:user_missions, 'AND user_missions.mission_id = 1').count\r\n```\r\nexpect it will generate this:\r\n```sql\r\nSELECT COUNT(*) FROM \"users\" \r\nLEFT OUTER JOIN \"user_missions\" ON \"user_missions\".\"user_id\" = \"users\".\"id\" AND user_missions.mission_id = 1\r\n```\r\nbut it raise `ArgumentError (only Hash, Symbol and Array are allowed)` instead.\r\n","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rails/rails/issues/comments/449286313/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"khiav223577","id":4011729,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQwMTE3Mjk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.gith