/rails/pull/35864","diff_url":"https://github.com/rails/rails/pull/35864.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/rails/rails/pull/35864.patch","merged_at":"2019-04-04T23:58:53Z"},"body":"Originally the `JoinDependency` has the deduplication for eager loading\r\n(LEFT JOIN). This re-uses that deduplication for `left_joins`.\r\n\r\nAnd also, This makes left join order into part of joins, i.e.:\r\n\r\nBefore:\r\n\r\n```\r\nassociation joins -> stash joins (eager loading, etc) -> string joins -> left joins\r\n```\r\n\r\nAfter:\r\n\r\n```\r\nassociation joins -> stash joins (eager loading, left joins, etc) -> string joins\r\n```\r\n\r\nNow string joins are able to refer left joins.\r\n\r\nFixes #34325.\r\nFixes #34332.\r\nFixes #34536.","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rails/rails/issues/35864/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rails/rails/issues/35864/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}},"event":"cross-referenced"}]